#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "504840"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF, #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF…\nThere are tons of things I want to know about,\nbut there's one Servant I HAVE to know about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "504996"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF.\nThat is, #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF's Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "505540"
msgid "\"#C000246204The Epic of Gilgamesh#CDEF\""
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "507288"
msgid "has been revealed."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "507376"
msgid "is related to his #C000246204SG#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "507420"
msgid "Return to #C000246204My Room#CDEF,"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "513156"
msgid "has been revealed."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "513292"
msgid "Return to #C000246204My Room#CDEF,"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "518620"
msgid "………………………………………………………………………\n…………………………………………………………………huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "519960"
msgid "I wonder what the king―#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF―was thinking at the time.\nIf I were to ask him, would he really answer?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "520272"
msgid "*kgh*! It won't open…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "520516"
msgid "I pull \"#C000246204The Epic of Gilgamesh#CDEF\" off the bookshelf again."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "520928"
msgid "has been revealed."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "521016"
msgid "is related to his final #C000246204SG#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "521064"
msgid "Return to #C000246204My Room#CDEF,"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "524300"
msgid "has been revealed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "529864"
msgid "The author is #C236196003Hans C. Andersen#CDEF―――\nThat's right. #C236196003Kiara#CDEF's Servant: \"him.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "530368"
msgid "Did that rude, caustic #C236196003Andersen#CDEF really write this…?\nIt's hard to believe, since I know him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "530516"
msgid "I could consider asking #C236196003Andersen#CDEF himself\nabout \"#C000246204The Little Mermaid#CDEF\" while I'm here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535680"
msgid "This really is amazing, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF.\nFeeling kind of impressed, I borrow \"#C000246204The Little Match Girl#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573020"
msgid "These shelves comprise the\ngeography and history sections."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573164"
msgid "These shelves comprise the\npolitics and economics sections."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573432"
msgid "These shelves comprise the\nsports and recreation section."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573568"
msgid "These shelves comprise the\nmedical science section."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575412"
msgid "Classes are……\nI'll explain it next time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575984"
msgid "Those 7 Classes are―――\n#C000246204Saber#CDEF, #C000246204Archer#CDEF, #C000246204Lancer#CDEF, #C000246204Rider#CDEF,\n#C000246204Caster#CDEF, #C000246204Berserker#CDEF, and #C000246204Assassin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576488"
msgid "Huh? An \"Idol\" Class……?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576520"
msgid "Yeah, sorry, but I've never heard of it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578492"
msgid "In these circumstances, we in management\nshould just surrender to #C236196003BB#CDEF if we value\nour lives."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579108"
msgid "After they completed the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF,\nthey deleted their own records\nand left this universe."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579280"
msgid "For a Lancer to become a Berserker,\ncommon sense really isn't popular\non the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF, is it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579508"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF is……\nNo, this can't be……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579796"
msgid "As long as you all possess\n\"the potential to overthrow #C236196003BB#CDEF,\"\n#C236196003BB#CDEF cannot enter the real world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580016"
msgid "Only God will know how this'll end.\nI can't predict it at all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580088"
msgid "Still, reach out for your future\ntill the very end, #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580608"
msgid "Those on the Near Side of the Moon\nprobably treat us as deserters,\nsince we \"exist\" as \"nothing.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581576"
msgid "…they say she's gone \"rogue,\"\nbut would a rogue AI be capable\nof such decisions?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582044"
msgid "………I'm disappointed.\nThat Master―#C236196003Julius#CDEF―raided us,\nbut #C236196003BB#CDEF didn't show up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582384"
msgid "………………yes?\nAh, you were talking to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582444"
msgid "I'm very sorry… I've lost confidence in my\nown opinions.\n…maybe I've given up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582768"
msgid "………………yeah.\nI knew it. Let's do that.\nIt makes the most sense…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582976"
msgid "If I want to become #C236196003BB#CDEF―――\nI should just let her consume me―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583760"
msgid "It's hard to tell you all this, but some\nof the NPCs support #C236196003BB#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584020"
msgid "What about me? I… I'm not sure.\nThis #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF wasn't particularly dear\nto me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584732"
msgid "But maybe there wasn't anything we could\ndo against this rogue advanced AI to\nbegin with."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584900"
msgid "We're losing one Master after another, \nand all I'm doing is watching…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585044"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF.\nCould you stop going to the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585144"
msgid "If we lose any more Masters…\nNo, this is inappropriate.\nAll I'm doing is imposing on you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585440"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF is doing exactly that.\nA humanoid AI can't bear all that weight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585604"
msgid "If #C236196003BB#CDEF ends up becoming the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF,\nwill we be serving #C236196003BB#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585900"
msgid "She's been shaking ever since she woke up.\nShe seems worried."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586148"
msgid "Yes, it IS strange.\nWhy would a regular student NPC like me be doing\nthings outside of my role?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586248"
msgid "\"#C236196003BB#CDEF\" is that girl, right…?\nThe AI you met in the Labyrinth who\nlooks exactly like #C236196003Sakura#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586576"
msgid "Don't worry. You won't vanish.\nI can see you clearly. So just relax, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587004"
msgid "F-fight! Tsukumihara, fight!\nDon't give in, you're beautiful, #C236196003Maki#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587180"
msgid "……………………………………\n……………………………………\n……………………………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587272"
msgid "……………………………………\n……………………………………\n……………………, ……………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588820"
msgid "…#C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF became a Labyrinth Core?\n…is that so? Awesome.\nIt's got nothing to do with us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588936"
msgid "I don't want to talk anymore.\nThat girl and I are just regular NPCs.\nResisting? Thinking? It's all meaningless."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589052"
msgid "She's so annoying!\nWhy is this girl so desperately…\nclasping my hand and stuff?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589160"
msgid "Ah, ah, aah! Aaah――\nWhy… do that to someone like me!?\nAah――! AAAHHH!!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589260"
msgid "…you're asking if I can ever regain\nself-control? Would if I could, but I fear\nI've lost the means."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589484"
msgid "I'm no advanced AI, but I'm a fairly capable\nNPC. That may be why #C236196003BB#CDEF tried to turn\nme into memory."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590292"
msgid "…I see. I think, now…\nNo, I knew this from the start."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590360"
msgid "…ah… augh, ahh!\nSorry, #C236196003Yuki#CDEF… I'm, sorry…!\nI can't save you――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590780"
msgid "Sorry I laughed it off before.\nI wanted to show you how amazing they are now."
msgstr ""

